Package: baseballscouting
Title: Baseball Scouting Report Generation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    c(person("Braeden", "Falzarano",,"bfalzarano@wesleyan.edu", role=c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Ernie", "Little",,"elittle@wesleyan.edu", role="aut"))
Description: The baseballscouting package allows users to analyze where pitchers and hitters struggle and where they excel. Beyond this, users can run a simulation to see how the pitcher and batter would fare if they were to face off in a real game.
